      "id": "claim_4982cacc08694b1c8d3e13afac57a8fd",
      "statement": "Dashboard sessions are HS256 JWTs signed with `DASHBOARD_JWT_SECRET`, valid for seven days, transported in an HttpOnly `osw_session` cookie, and rejected by `require_session` when missing or invalid; cookie SameSite and Secure attributes depend on whether the dashboard is split-origin HTTPS.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/dashboard/oauth.py#L188-L216",
