      "statement": "Dashboard startup requires either `ALLOWED_GITHUB_ORGS` or `ALLOWED_GITHUB_USERS` unless `OPEN_SWE_LOCAL_AUTH_TOKEN` is configured; a GitHub login is authorized by an explicit case-insensitive match or active membership in an allowed organization, with membership lookup failures denying access.",
