      "id": "claim_83dc8015cf6a48cdbb5854556a48b4e3",
      "statement": "Desktop authentication returns a 120-second signed handoff code to a fixed 127.0.0.1 callback and mints a session only after a constant-time PKCE S256 verifier check; cloud-terminal tickets expire after 60 seconds and are bound to both audience and thread ID.",
