      "statement": "All dashboard API routes use the mutation origin dependency: safe HTTP methods are exempt, bearer-only GitHub requests without a session cookie are exempt, and configured deployments otherwise require an allowed Origin or Referer; absent dashboard origins intentionally make the check a local-development no-op.",
