      "id": "claim_0e7102e1d70b44f38d4a083bfbb312c1",
      "statement": "GitHub credential selection is thread-scope based: only a private thread whose recorded owner matches the run login can resolve that person's OAuth token; public threads use an App token, and a missing private token raises `GitHubUserAuthRequired` rather than falling back to App authority.",
